Simulated describes "Machine target is P1000Simulator; no physical adapter activation.".
PhysicalPassive describes "Machine target is P1000Gateway for passive observation; physical write capability disabled.".
OfflineReplay describes "Isolated recorded inputs; server-configured replay target, never live historical control.".
ReactView describes "Select React adapter for an identified operator/simulator context; host placement remains open.".
FyneView describes "Select native Fyne adapter under the same logical Presentation contract; no mandatory IPC implied.".
HeadlessView describes "Select semantic test adapter; does not prove pixels, layout or accessibility.".
LiveInspection describes "Current input required for fresh displays; disconnected retained values are explicitly stale.".
MVP1 specifies "Target selections Simulated and PhysicalPassive are mutually exclusive for one MachineService target session. Renderer selection is scoped per UI context. No implicit all-to-all delivery.".
